UPDATE companies SET description='Crabtree Auto operates from Riverdale, Utah, just outside Ogden. The business traces its roots to a post-World War II body shop in Logan, where the Crabtree brothers began selling parts from their own vehicles. That parts operation evolved into a full-scale salvage yard, and in 1947 the company relocated to its current Riverdale location. Dahl Crabtree became sole owner and later passed the business to his sons, Miles and Colin Crabtree, who modernized the facilities. Today the third generation of the family directs the company.

The yard purchases damaged vehicles ten model years old or newer, then dismantles, cleans, and tests the usable components. Inventory includes transmissions, engines, body panels (bumpers, fenders, hoods, doors), lighting, glass, mirrors, interior parts, tires, wheels, drivetrain and brake components. Thousands of cars and light trucks are pre-dismantled and shelved for immediate pickup or delivery. The facility serves both walk-in customers and commercial accounts across northern Utah.

Primary customers are collision repair shops, insurance companies, other salvage yards, and individual vehicle owners.

Crabtree Auto distinguishes itself through its ARA Certified Auto Recycler status and membership in the United Recyclers Group, which requires adherence to quality standards for recycled parts. The operation’s long-standing slogan — “CLEAN - ORGANIZED - QUICK SERVICE” — reflects its focus on facility upkeep and fast turnaround.', certifications=ARRAY['ARA Certified Auto Recycler','United Recyclers Group (URG) member']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Auto salvage", "Vehicle acquisition (damaged vehicles 10 years old and newer)", "Parts dismantling", "Parts cleaning and testing", "Inventory management and shelving", "Parts sales (new and used)", "Parts delivery"], "industries": ["Collision repair shops", "Insurance companies", "Salvage yards", "Individual vehicle owners", "Commercial fleets"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ARA Certified Auto Recycler", "United Recyclers Group member with quality standards", "Pre-dismantled, cleaned, and tested parts ready for delivery", "Family-owned, third-generation operation", "\"CLEAN - ORGANIZED - QUICK SERVICE\" operating philosophy"], "facts_used": ["Location: Riverdale, Utah -> db", "Founded as body shop in Logan after WWII -> /about-us", "Crabtree brothers started selling parts -> /about-us", "Relocated to Riverdale in 1947 -> /about-us", "Dahl Crabtree sole owner, sons Miles and Colin took over -> /about-us", "Third generation now directs -> /about-us", "Purchases damaged vehicles 10 years old and newer -> /", "Sells undamaged parts to body shops, individuals -> /", "Parts salvaged: transmissions, engines, bumpers, fenders, lights, windshields, mirrors, dashboards, tires, wheels, grills, hoods, trunks, axles, brake drums, doors -> /", "Pre-dismantled, cleaned, tested parts on shelves -> /about-us", "Serves shops, insurance companies, salvage yards, local customers -> /about-us", "ARA Certified Auto Recycler -> /about-us", "United Recyclers Group member -> /about-us", "Slogan: CLEAN - ORGANIZED - QUICK SERVICE -> /about-us", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Company type: retailer of used auto parts -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Crabtree Auto buys damaged vehicles that are 10 years old and newer, and we sell the undamaged parts to body shops, individuals and more.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='crabtree-auto' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
