UPDATE companies SET description='Creation Technologies is headquartered in Westminster, Colorado, and was founded in 1991 on the principle that electronics manufacturing should be a collaborative partnership rather than a transactional exchange. The company has grown from that founding belief into a global electronics manufacturing services (EMS) provider with 13 manufacturing locations across the United States, Canada, Mexico, and China.

The company delivers end-to-end electronics manufacturing, spanning design engineering, new product introduction (NPI), printed circuit board assembly, box build, system integration, interconnect solutions, sheet metal fabrication, conformal coating, and aftermarket repair and refurbishment. Its global team of over 3,000 professionals supports low- to mid-volume production for complex, regulated programs, with dedicated rapid prototyping and value-engineering centers in Denver and other sites.

Creation serves three core markets: aerospace and defense, medical and life sciences, and tech industrial. Its customer base includes OEMs building mission-critical systems such as defense communications and emergency response equipment, dental diagnostic devices, hard-disk-drive tracking systems, automatic test equipment, and vehicle data solutions. The company holds ITAR registration, FDA registration, and Canadian Controlled Goods certification to meet the security and regulatory demands of these sectors.

Creation differentiates itself with a ''Thinking in Action'' continuous-improvement methodology that has helped customers cut inventory carrying costs by up to 65%, halve field failure rates, and raise on-time shipment performance from 80% to 98.4%. The firm emphasizes lean production programs, proactive supply chain risk mitigation, and a culture described as ''big enough to scale, small enough to care.''', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','ISO 14001:2015','AS9100D','UL','CSA','TUV','CE','FDA Registered','FM','MET','ETL','IEC','IECEx','JPAL','IPC RoHS Compliance Certification','ITAR Registration','Canadian Controlled Goods Directorate (CGD) Registration','C-TPAT Registration','IPC-A-610 Class 2 and Class 3','IPC-J-STD-001 Class 2 and Class 3','MIL-STD-810F','IPC/WHMA-A-620','MIL-STD Wiring','MIL-DTL-3100']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electronics manufacturing services (EMS)", "Printed circuit board assembly (PCBA)", "Box build and system integration", "Engineering services (DFM/DFA/DFT, VAVE)", "New Product Introduction (NPI) with LEAP stage-gate methodology", "Strategic supply chain management", "Interconnect solutions (cable, harness, MIL-SPEC wiring)", "Aftermarket services (repair, refurbishment, parts management)", "Sheet metal fabrication and finishing", "Conformal coating and potting", "Rapid prototyping (Creation Express Services)", "Complex test programs (RF, ESS, environmental stress screening)", "Counterfeit part prevention and detection", "Obsolescence and end-of-life component management", "Global sourcing and lean procurement", "Plan for Every Part (PFEP) and vendor-managed inventory", "Regulatory compliance support (FDA, ITAR, CGD, C-TPAT)", "Large electromechanical assembly", "Product lifecycle management (PLM) and sustaining engineering"], "industries": ["Aerospace & Defense", "Medical & Life Sciences", "Tech Industrial", "Industrial Controls", "Transportation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Low to mid-