UPDATE companies SET description='Creations Foods US Inc. operates a state-of-the-art baking facility in Ferndale, Washington, positioned in the Pacific Northwest with access to major shipping routes across the U.S. and Canada. The company runs an SQF-certified, gluten-free plant designed for industrial-scale production of baked snacks.

The facility houses specialized high-volume inline ovens that produce extruded baked goods and sandwich cookies. An in-house innovation team develops gluten-free recipes for cookies, crackers, cheese crisps, and granola. Creations Foods manufactures its own branded lines — including Moon Cheese, Highkey Snacks, AwYeah, and REAL COOKIES — while also providing private-label and co-manufacturing services for partner brands. Finished goods are packed in stand-up pouches for retail distribution.

The company serves retailers and national brands seeking gluten-free snack production. Creations Foods emphasizes a commercialization process that moves concepts from development through to high-volume output.

