UPDATE companies SET description='Creative Sound operates from Blair Park in Williston, Vermont. The company was started in 1967 and has served the Burlington area as an audio/video specialty electronics dealer for over five decades. Ownership details and founder names are not disclosed in the available sources.

The business functions as both a retailer and an installation service provider. Its showroom carries a curated selection of high-fidelity audio components, video products, accessories, and home automation systems, with brands such as McIntosh, Rotel, Dynaudio, and Control4. Services include custom installation for residential and vehicle environments, audio/video system design consultation, and product auditioning. Facility size, headcount, and sales volumes are not publicly specified.

The primary customer base consists of residential consumers — audiophiles, home theater enthusiasts, and homeowners seeking automation or car audio upgrades. The company also supports custom integration projects for home control, lighting, and HVAC through its Control4 authorization.

Creative Sound differentiates itself through an educational sales approach, emphasizing product suitability over inventory turnover. Staff members, some with more than 35 years of experience, guide customers through auditioning and selection to minimize returns. The firm holds Control4 Authorized Gold Dealer status and provides expert installation in homes and vehicles.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom installation", "Home automation integration (Control4)", "Car audio installation", "Audio/video system consultation", "Product auditioning and demonstration", "Retail sales of audio/video components"], "industries": ["Residential audio/video", "Custom electronics installation", "Home automation", "Car audio"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Control4 Authorized Gold Dealer", "Staff with over 35 years of industry experience", "Educational, needs-based sales approach", "In-home and in-vehicle expert installation"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1967 -> /", "Headquarters Williston, VT -> /", "Audio/video specialty electronics dealer -> /", "Control4 Authorized Gold Dealer -> /", "Staff with over 35 years experience -> /", "Custom installation services for home and vehicle -> /", "Brands carried: McIntosh, Rotel, Dynaudio, Control4 -> /", "Educational sales approach -> /", "Product auditioning in showroom -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Started in 1967, Creative Sound is the Burlington area''s longest running audio/video specialty electronics dealer.", "founded_year": "1967", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='creative-sound' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
