UPDATE companies SET description='Cretex Medical operates from Elk River, Minnesota, as part of the privately held Cretex Companies, which traces its ownership back more than 100 years. The business is led by Jeff Wollerman, president and CEO of Cretex Companies, and focuses exclusively on contract manufacturing and engineering services for the medical device sector.

The company provides end-to-end manufacturing capabilities including additive manufacturing, machining, metal fabrication, molding, laser processing, stamping, assembly, sterile packaging, and sterilization management. Engineering services cover phased design support, precision tooling, process validation, and project management. Cretex Medical reports producing over one million device components per day and can deliver production-quality prototypes in as little as two weeks, supported by in-house tool design and maintenance.

Cretex Medical serves medical device OEMs across therapeutic areas such as minimally invasive procedures and intervention, robotics, orthopaedics and sports medicine, and neuro and cardiac stimulation.

The company emphasizes its private ownership structure, which enables quick decision-making and capital investment at three times the industry average. It promotes a single-source model with billing simplicity, no markups, and faster turnaround, backed by ISO 13485, ISO 9001, MedAccred (QTS) certifications and FDA registration.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001 Certified','ISO 13485 Certified','MedAccred Certified (QTS)','FDA Registered']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Additive Manufacturing", "Assembly", "Laser Processing", "Machining", "Metal Fabrication", "Molding", "Prototyping", "Secondary Processing", "Stamping", "Sterile Packaging", "Sterilization Management", "Phased Design Support", "Precision Tooling", "Process Validations", "Project Management"], "industries": ["Medical Devices", "Minimal Invasive Procedures & Intervention", "Robotics", "Orthopaedics & Sports Med", "Neuro & Cardio Stimulation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Over 1 million device components per day; prototyping in as little as 2 weeks", "lead_time": "Prototyping in as little as 2 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 1 million device components produced daily", "Prototyping in as little as 2 weeks", "In-house precision tooling design and maintenance", "End-to-end contract manufacturing and engineering under one roof", "Private ownership enabling quick decisions and 3x industry average annual investment"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Elk River, MN -> /", "Over 1 million device components per day -> /", "Prototyping in as little as 2 weeks -> /", "Certifications: ISO 13485, FDA Registered, MedAccred (QTS), ISO 9001 -> /", "Private ownership, over 100 years history -> /", "Therapeutic areas: Minimal Invasive Procedures & Intervention, Robotics, Orthopaedics & Sports Med, Neuro & Cardio Stimulation -> /", "Manufacturing services list -> /", "Engineering services list -> /", "In-house tool making -> /", "Jeff Wollerman, President & CEO, Cretex Companies -> /about",