UPDATE companies SET description='Cush Suspensions operates from Nixa, Missouri, where it was founded to challenge a heavy-duty suspension market that had seen little change in decades. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but its origin story centers on a decision to engineer suspensions that fit specific applications rather than forcing customers into standard offerings.

The company designs and manufactures both engineered-to-order and standard suspension systems for trucks and trailers. Its process begins with listening to the customer''s application requirements, then developing a tailored solution through a streamlined engineering and manufacturing workflow. Details on facility size, headcount, annual volumes, or part-number counts are not publicly provided.

Cush serves OEM manufacturers and trailer builders across the heavy-duty transportation sector. Its customer base ranges from regional trailer builders to large-scale OEMs, with cited partnerships including Globe Trailer and Diamond C Trailers. The company also supports aftermarket needs for existing fleets.

Cush differentiates itself by rejecting cookie-cutter approaches in favor of custom-engineered suspensions, emphasizing speed to market, incorporation of the latest technology, and flexibility for unique applications. The company states it was started because the suspension market had stagnated, and it aims to deliver a ''Cush Ride'' that is faster, more flexible, and more collaborative than traditional suppliers.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Engineered-to-order suspension design", "Custom suspension manufacturing", "Standard suspension production", "Service and repair", "Suspension engineering and manufacturing"], "industries": ["Heavy-duty truck manufacturing", "Trailer manufacturing", "OEM manufacturing", "Aftermarket suspension"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Engineered-to-order suspensions tailored to each application", "Streamlined process for fastest time to market", "Continuous integration of latest suspension technology", "Custom configurations for unique truck and trailer applications", "Partnerships with OEMs and trailer builders like Globe Trailer and Diamond C Trailers"], "facts_used": ["Location: Nixa, MO -> /", "Business: engineered-to-order and standard suspensions for trucks/trailers -> /", "Partners: Globe Trailer, Diamond C Trailers -> /", "Differentiators: engineered to order, fastest to market, latest tech, custom solutions -> /", "Industries: OEM manufacturers, trailer builders, aftermarket -> /", "Address: 1001 Falconcrest Court, Nixa, MO 65714 -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Cush Suspensions is a full solution provider that combines innovation and quality to give you a truly unique, engineered to order suspension", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=n