UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Battery Cables LLC operates from Mesa, Arizona. The business was launched in 2003 by founder Vince, who began building cables for his own 1948 Willy’s CJ‑2A while studying diesel and heavy‑equipment technology at Maricopa Technical Community College. After a career as a mechanic for firms such as Mountain Bell and Sunstate Equipment, and a 29‑year tenure at Intel in electronics engineering, Vince started the company from a spare room in his home.

The shop hand‑builds made‑to‑order battery cables for cars, trucks, boats, RVs, golf carts, solar installations and heavy equipment. Cables are assembled to the customer’s exact length using SAE SGT, SGX or marine‑grade wire, and the company also produces alternator wires with fuse links. A team of seven — including a manufacturing manager, shipping lead, marketing lead and several technicians — handles production, assembly and customer support.

The primary markets are automotive, marine, solar, recreational vehicle, golf‑cart and heavy‑equipment sectors. Customers range from individual owners restoring classic vehicles or upgrading high‑output engines to commercial buyers placing bulk orders for fleet or industrial use. The company explicitly invites bulk inquiries alongside its direct‑to‑consumer sales.

Vince’s guiding principle, drawn from a mentor’s advice, is to “solve the customer’s problem” — whether that means fixing a hard‑starting snowplow or supplying show‑quality cables. The company differentiates itself by using heavier, higher‑grade wire than typical OEM or auto‑store cables, refusing to cut corners on materials, and building each cable to withstand extreme temperatures and demanding electrical loads.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom battery cable manufacturing", "Hand\u2011built cable assembly", "Cable customization to exact length", "Use of SAE SGT, SGX, and marine\u2011grade cable", "Alternator cable assembly with fuse links", "Bulk order fulfillment"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Marine", "Solar", "Recreational vehicles (RV)", "Golf cart", "Heavy equipment", "Classic car restoration", "High\u2011performance engines"], "materials": ["SAE SGT cable", "SGX cable", "Marine\u2011grade cable"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom\u2011made to exact length", "No cutting corners on materials", "Built for demanding conditions (extreme temperatures, older batteries/starters)", "Higher\u2011grade wire than OEM or auto\u2011store cables", "Handcrafted in the USA"], "facts_used": ["Location: Mesa, Arizona -> db", "Founded 2003 by Vince -> /about-us", "Founder background: mechanic, Intel engineer -> /about-us", "Hand\u2011built custom battery cables -> /", "Materials: SAE SGT, SGX, marine\u2011grade cable -> /", "Team of seven named employees -> /about-us", "Industries served: automotive, marine, solar, RV, golf cart, heavy equipment -> /", "Differentiators: custom length, no cutting corners, demanding conditions, higher\u2011grade wire -> /", "Philosophy: solve the customer''s problem -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "At Custom Battery Cables, we specialize in building premium, made-to-order battery cables for cars, tr